{number: 123}
{title: Father God Will I Know}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
Father God, will I know you are gracious,
And I know of your love for all men,
Will I know that your love never changes,
There is hope for the ones yet in sin.
O Lord fill me now with Thy spirit,
As I wait, fill me now Lord I pray,
Till the fire of your Spirit consumes me,
Fill my heart in your own special way.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
By the power of the spirit within me,
Cleanse my heart of the black stains of sin,
Till my heart burns no more in its passion,
Till my longings are holy and clean.
O Lord fill me now with Thy spirit,
As I wait, fill me now Lord I pray,
Till the fire of your Spirit consumes me,
Fill my heart in your own special way.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
Lord I know that you died for the sinner,
That your death gave new hope to all men,
As in power from the tomb you ascended,
So in power come upon us again.
O Lord fill me now with Thy spirit,
As I wait, fill me now Lord I pray,
Till the fire of your Spirit consumes me,
Fill my heart in your own special way.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
Lord I know that you died for the sinner,
That your death gave new hope to all men,
As in power from the tomb you ascended,
So in power come upon us again.
O Lord fill me now with Thy spirit,
As I wait, fill me now Lord I pray,
Till the fire of your Spirit consumes me,
Fill my heart in your own special way.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 5}
Till the earth is rolled up like a garment,
Till the end of this age comes to be;
Let us cease not our praise nor thanksgiving,
Let us thank Him for setting us free.
O Lord fill me now with Thy spirit,
As I wait, fill me now Lord I pray,
Till the fire of your Spirit consumes me,
Fill my heart in your own special way.
{end_of_verse}
